Error [jet.UnknownCoreModule]: `core.text.runtime.kernel_unicode_string` is private to Core
  --> user_program_cannot_import_a_runtime_unit.jet:1:11
    |
  1 | use rt :: core.text.runtime.kernel_unicode_string
